1
00:00:00,003 --> 00:00:03,197
I changed how we check
medicines at discharge.

2
00:00:03,197 --> 00:00:07,588
I saw her do it. She noticed what
everyone else missed.

3
00:00:07,588 --> 00:00:11,579
Somebody made care better today. Did
anyone write it down?

4
00:00:11,629 --> 00:00:14,873
This is Evinca. Your best work,

5
00:00:14,873 --> 00:00:16,495
recognised on evidence.

6
00:00:16,545 --> 00:00:19,994
Every story of better care has
three people in it.

7
00:00:19,994 --> 00:00:22,063
The one who did the work.

8
00:00:22,063 --> 00:00:25,857
The one who noticed. And the one
who was cared for.

9
00:00:25,996 --> 00:00:28,643
Most people underestimate their own work.

10
00:00:28,643 --> 00:00:33,938
Two minutes, no account, and you will see
what your evidence deserves.

11
00:00:33,988 --> 00:00:35,771
I shared my story for free,

12
00:00:35,771 --> 00:00:37,852
and verified it when I was ready.

13
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:43,134
From Recife to Riyadh, every contribution
is judged in its own context,

14
00:00:43,134 --> 00:00:47,647
not against a hospital on the
other side of the world.

15
00:00:47,697 --> 00:00:52,988
Four marks of recognition. One
verified record behind each.

16
00:00:53,038 --> 00:00:57,712
Free to share. Four levels. An eight
seat editorial board.

17
00:00:57,712 --> 00:01:00,984
And one public record behind every honor.

18
00:01:01,034 --> 00:01:05,859
Every honoree receives a cover. And every
cover states what was measured,

19
00:01:05,859 --> 00:01:09,075
what it was compared with, and its limits.

20
00:01:09,125 --> 00:01:12,869
Thirty eight years of teaching,
finally on the record.

21
00:01:13,352 --> 00:01:18,298
Anyone can check a record. Even
corrections are made in public.

22
00:01:18,348 --> 00:01:20,376
And yes, there is a certificate.

23
00:01:20,376 --> 00:01:22,404
With a code anyone can scan.

24
00:01:22,576 --> 00:01:25,863
Every claim is checked before
anyone decides.

25
00:01:25,863 --> 00:01:30,557
If a reviewer knows you, an external
reviewer decides instead.

26
00:01:30,557 --> 00:01:34,313
Appeals and corrections stay on
the public record.

27
00:01:34,363 --> 00:01:38,967
Evinca Academy teaches the skills
behind great evidence,

28
00:01:38,967 --> 00:01:42,420
from quality improvement
storyboards to Kaizen.

29
00:01:42,470 --> 00:01:46,574
Then turn your recognition into a CV
that recruiters actually read.

30
00:01:46,683 --> 00:01:48,958
And plan your next ninety days,

31
00:01:48,958 --> 00:01:51,613
one small, dated step at a time.

32
00:01:51,663 --> 00:01:52,025
Your work already made a difference.

33
00:01:52,025 --> 00:01:52,506
Let Evinca make it visible.
Start your story,

34
00:01:52,506 --> 00:01:52,567
free.

